{"symbol":"ARCAD.AS","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-09T20:01:32Z","info":{"address1":"Gustav Mahlerplein 97-103","city":"Amsterdam","zip":"1082 MS","country":"Netherlands","phone":"31 88 426 1261","website":"https://www.arcadis.com","industry":"Engineering & Construction","industryKey":"engineering-construction","industryDisp":"Engineering & Construction","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Arcadis NV engages in the design, engineering, architecture, and consultancy solutions for natural and built assets in The Americas, Europe, the Middle East, and the Asia Pacific. The company operates through Places, Mobility, Resilience, and Intelligence segments. It provides architecture and urbanism services; and asset management services, such as asset management strategy and planning, asset management decision making and operational optimization, life cycle planning and asset management systems, asset information/condition assessment, risk and review, organization and people, and asset management/O&M. The company also provides business advisory services, including asset strategy and performance, business transformation and resiliency, investment and finance, operations and maintenance, and technology and information; contract solutions; cost and commercial management services; and design and engineering solutions for highways, railways, bridges, tunnels, power utilities, water utilities, ports and waterways, geotechnics, architecture, and structures, as well as building mechanical, electrical, and plumbing. In addition, it offers digital environmental health safety and sustainability, environmental restoration, and project management solutions. Further, the company provides mobility solutions for connected highways, intelligent rail and transit, integrated airports, and new mobility; places solutions; resilience solutions, such as energy transition, climate adaption, water optimization, enviro socio permitting, sustainable advisory, environmental restoration, and sustainable operations; and water supply and treatment, distribution, resource management, and industrial water and wastewater services. The company was formerly known as Heidemij NV and changed its name to Arcadis N.V. in October 1997. The company was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Amsterdam, the Netherlands.","fullTimeEmployees":31361,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Simon P. Crowe","age":58,"title":"CFO & Member of Executive Board","yearBorn":1967,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":718000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Heather L. Polinsky","age":52,"title":"Chair of the Executive Board & CEO","yearBorn":1973,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Hans  Dekker M.Sc.","age":58,"title":"Chief Operating Officer","yearBorn":1967,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Nick  Henderson","title":"Technical Director","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Christine  Disch","title":"Head of Investor Relations","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Barbara C. P. van Koppen","age":59,"title":"Global General Counsel","yearBorn":1966,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Jana  Belyusova","title":"Chief People Officer","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Kamiran  Ibrahim","title":"Chief Executive Officer for Middle East","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Felipe Alceu Amoroso Lima","title":"Chief Executive Officer of Latin American Region","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Edel  Christie","age":55,"title":"Global President of Places","yearBorn":1970,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":1,